Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were underground when we met the most\Ndisgusting creatures ever, the Numemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there's like this\Ngiant stuffed bear named
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monzaemon attacking us\Nwith his floating hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and Palmon got away,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the rest of the kids got like\Nhypnotized and taken to Toy Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here the toys play with the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:02:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things were totally like bad that's when\Nthe icky Numemon came to help which kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of freaked me and saved the\Nday. It's not bad for a plant, I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:15.02,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}A Roar! Ikkakumon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is no day at the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beach Joe but that's\Nno reason to be a worry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worried about it and make all your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unhappy pardon the pun But chill out Only\Nyou have a problem with the cold Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone think warm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic to fur
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys The\Ncold isn't that terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps not if you're a\Npolar bear or a penguin Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if it snows We'll throw some snowballs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make snowmen Who\Ndo you think Snimon is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Digimon from their planet\NIt's difficult to explain Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it's edible, count me in No,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the best thing about snowballs is\Nthat you can throw them at each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a fun game that we\Nplay in the winter months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You throw food?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could even build a snow fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I could beat you both blindfolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to build an igloo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help if you tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An igloo sounds scrumptious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad they're not edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be horrible if it\Nstarted snowing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lighten up a little, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just trying to look on\Nthe positive side of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai, when's it gonna snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, probably any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on Joe's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, if the temperature drops\Nany lower than it is already,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we won't be able to camp out anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be frozen Digitreats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when your tootsies\Nfreeze, don't go crying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just say I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is always better to be safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that white stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a field of snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's bound to be a ski resort nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, this is much worse\Nthan even I thought it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to get\Nanywhere just sitting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we walk across the field in our\Nsneakers, our toes will go numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are we supposed to do, just\Nstand here like a bunch of dorks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We either go across the field\Nor climb up that big mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there's a weird odor in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do believe he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it smells like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's steam. She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big geyser. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yippee, now I can take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can get warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, this water's much too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be cooked if we jumped in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, boiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there go my big\Ndreams of a nice warm bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks so inviting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it would be inviting\Nif you were a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a little dirt compared to starving?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to find something to eat\Nand there's nothing in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here but a bunch\Nof rocks and boiling water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm not imagining this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would a refrigerator\Nbe doing way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where there's a fridge, there's grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't know till we open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really think that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want hot cocoa. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on already, let's\Nsee what's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a zillion of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, grub on, these will\Nkeep us all fat for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, you\Nshouldn't even touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know if they're\Nfit for human consumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be the guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I turn purple, you'll\Nknow they're not edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they were edible,\Nthey don't belong to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd make us all thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to think about\Nstuff like that, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:06:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you're into eating rocks,\Nwe don't have too much choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'd say yes if\Nthey knew we were in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd tell them it's an\Nemergency situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rationalize away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunny side up eggs are my specialty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.24,0:06:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone, I can't wait
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, man, how are\Nthose chopsticks coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we want to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this just makes me feel\Nuncomfortable We'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in big trouble if someone\Ngot sick No doctors,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I always have to be the\None to think about these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trey gourmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, dig in. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a meal\Nlike this in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach's chiming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had some ketchup to go\Nwith this, it would be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, I love ketchup and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty gross to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't eaten anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was just thinking that\Nif we were able to go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ketchup wouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now I'm homesick. How depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been four days since we've been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if anyone's tried\Nto find out where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me how you like your eggs,\Nand I'll try to do my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I prefer my eggs to be covered in salt\Nand pepper, but I guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like soy sauce. How about salsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a reality check?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have mine with mustard\Nand jelly beans, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How gross. Jelly beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds good. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My favorite is eggs topped\Nwith maple syrup. Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I like them\Nwith cherries on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I bet it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making me completely\Nlose my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just like plain eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish we could talk about\Nsomething other than egg recipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:07:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, join the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's really too late for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I think Joe thinks we've gone\Na little crazy over these eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.02,0:08:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jelly beans and cherries on eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salt and pepper's all they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's always been my motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Joe's just not the kind\Nof guy that's meant to be adaptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's face it, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kind of a stick in\Nthe mud if you get my drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just practical. You're stuffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It never fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone has to have a head of the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I am calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who's dingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why'd you squeeze my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to be yourself today, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a basket case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am just trying to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike the rest of you weirdos, I'm\Ntelling you, you're all asking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to be the\Ncautious one around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The voice of reason, I have to.\NWhy are you making such a big
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deal out of this because it's way\Ntoo dangerous there's no place
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,else to go we have no choice look\Nbefore we do something foolish
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should think it over a little\Nmore you're just a big old
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chicken everybody what's all the\Nruckus about why are matt and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kai fighting you are too they're\Ndebating about whether or not
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should climb infinity mountain\Nwhich is way up over there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's practically up to the\Nsky. Infinity Mountain's a doozy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta climb up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best view of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to admit\Nhe's got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how Matt sees it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody would make it up that peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much too big of a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be right, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There could be lots of\Nevil Digimon up that peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be worth the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a wimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't get anywhere if we\Njust stand around talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your fist down when you talk\Nto me and stop acting like you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can just bully your way into being\Nthe leader what are you saying
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knock it off you guys chill out\Nnow look here calm down let's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be sensible so what's your opinion\Nabout this joe huh yeah joe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell us who's right me or matt uh\Num well i think ty's right about
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going up that peak if we went\Nup there we'd be able to see the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,landscape of the island a lot\Nbetter see matt hold on matt brought
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up a real good point about the\Ndanger it'd be kind of dumb to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lead everybody up to a place\Nwe don't know anything about it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be safe? Uh, come on, let's\Ngo as far as we can up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's stupid we can't protect\Nourselves out there stop it now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're both making me a nervous\Nwreck just give me a chance to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think don't be difficult what\Nyou are the most difficult person
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i ever met hey i am trying to\Nmake a decision here so don't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,interrupt me you're just a big old\Nchicken matt Tai you better take
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That back enough already. You're\Ngiving I'm talking at you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to decide what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.06,0:11:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's going to get dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we ought to get a little shut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be plenty\Nof time to argue later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First of all, we need to\Nfind a good place to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head for the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll stay warm in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their lives depend on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been good at climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the best chance\Nof making it to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you up to, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, you're not gonna\Nclimb that mountain by
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mama? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgotten me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go get some sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going, so quit\Nfollowing me around. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I have some business\Nto take care of up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything doesn't revolve around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I just have to trick them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice night for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so bad about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,infinity mountain is a lot bigger\Nthan i thought it was are you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready to quit we can turn around\Nof course not i can give you a hand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh hand oh you call that a hand\Nwatch it i was kidding lighten
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up huh what's wrong i think you\Nactually have a sense of humor. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe not. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to take a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks to me\Nlike we're halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We make quite a team. Actually, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think this mountain is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Volcano?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there! The black gears are\Ncoming from the top of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i guess there's no running\Naway this time let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm sure i saw them up here\Nwhere could they have gone
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would it be too much to hope\Nthey disappeared all together
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have to climb up there and see
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound, way up there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.23,0:14:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's just great A flying\Nhorse wearing a mask This can't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be good That's not your\Neveryday kind of flying horse,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:35.26,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}UNIMON
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:35.26,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Phantom Beast\NDigimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:35.26,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:35.26,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:35.26,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:35.26,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:35.26,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Holy Shot
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe That's Unimon He's a\Nwise old Digimon I never knew
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he lived in these mountains\NHe's not much of a talker
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hide Unamon's very gentle We don't\Nhave to hide from him Your information
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hasn't always been reliable cold but true\Nhe must be coming down to have a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i guess that's his watering\Nhole you see i told
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you he was a nice digimon\Nhe wouldn't hurt a fly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wow what a beautiful looking horse maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unimon will tell us what\Nwe need to know then
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could go back to our\Nfriends hello Unimon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's me gummon it's been a long time since
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what is it? What's going\Non? I hear something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something's coming toward us can't you\Nsee it Joe oh no it's the black deer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wow
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you think he's in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, we'll have to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, look at his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the ones that are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For once we agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure slept well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Sleepy Joe is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:15:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait for me, signed Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't be climbing that\Nmountain by himself, would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a good time, dear guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the mood for a\Ngame of aerial attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something, Wilma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking of leaving, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a perfectly safe route if\Nyou're thinking of flying away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aerial attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon, we've come to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in time, I'd say. Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aerial attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akuma, did you fall into...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon, are you gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm styling, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon and Tyre are in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going after Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another uninvited guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:17:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.30,0:18:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now. Hang on.\NOh, no. It won't punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but I just have\Nto do this one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stop until it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to think positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digivice 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, Joe, because\Nwe're going for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartful torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's much too fast for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the black gear just dissolved yeah you\Nsaved the day hope i didn't shake you too
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much time that was a\Nreally close call good
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,job that's what i call pulling it together
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wow joe you were jamming\Nout there you're a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty cool dude after\Nall You were so awesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it made it possible for\NGomamon to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not why I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm just a nice guy, and\Nbesides, Joe would have fallen on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.20,0:20:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't have\Nanything better to do anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you don't believe me, then put\Nup your dukes and let's fight about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just chill, Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best, and\Nheroes don't have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, oh, heroes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, Go-Momon's embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, I'm no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go all the way up to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew we could do it. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not much out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Golemon and I fought all the way\Nto the top to see what was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we found, well, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think we discovered\Nquite a bit on the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to see what you can\Nsee. It's not all that you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm wearing a jacket. I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know when I'm going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See what you can see. I'm\Ngoing to see what you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all the keys of\Nthe devil will come to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next episode of Digimon Adventure:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.28,0:23:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The adventure of Digimon\Nis going to happen.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.04,0:24:00.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fs30\b1}The Messenger of Darkness, Devimon!

